title: The cost record
pid: 8bd0b2ca-30e5-4e04-bce9-b17212ed6673
body: |2-
  Record each slice's launch and report times in 'progress.org',
  so that the review can give durations per slice and the next
  plan can be budgeted. Take each time from 'date -u' at the
  moment, never from an estimate: in plan 2_2 the orchestrator's
  estimated times drifted twenty minutes from the commits' times.
